    {
      "id": "2nq8nk5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "5.Town Planning"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8t26p5k",
      "content": "• Cities were divided into Citadel and Lower Town"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "utqrb0w",
      "content": "• Houses were made of baked bricks"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6jujnuk",
      "content": "• Roads intersected at right angles"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ob1my5k",
      "content": "• Covered drainage system was highly advanced"
    },
    {
      "id": "eqcwtnb",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6.Economy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b57zl3v",
      "content": "• Agriculture was the main occupation"
    },
    {
      "type": "comparisonTable",
      "headers": [
        "Major IVC Site",
        "Key Archaeological Findings & Importance"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Harappa",
          "Six granaries in a row, Coffin burial, Virgin Goddess figurine"
        ],
        [
          "Mohenjo-daro",
          "Great Bath, Great Granary, Bronze Dancing Girl, Pashupati Seal"
        ],
        [
          "Lothal",
          "Artificial Dockyard, Rice husk evidence, Terracotta horse figurine"
        ],
        [
          "Dholavira",
          "Unique water management reservoir, Signboard inscription, 3-part city division"
        ]
      ],
      "id": "0ph9kip"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8icq85x",
      "content": "• Wheat and barley were major crops"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "yajkv8u",
      "content": "• Trade existed with Mesopotamia"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yxfua1i",
      "content": "• Standard weights and measures were used"
    },
    {
      "id": "ixl70a6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "7.Religion"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "awglwtw",
      "content": "• Worship of Mother Goddess"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zcjjy7o",
      "content": "• Pashupati seal suggests proto‑Shiva worship                                                     "
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k7da9e2",
      "content": "• Sacred animals included bull and unicorn"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tkprusz",
      "content": "• Peepal tree considered sacred"
    },
    {
      "id": "80g03u0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "8.Decline of the Indus Valley Civilization"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lu9uenu",
      "content": "• Climate change and drying of rivers"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "n1xr566",
      "content": "• Floods and natural disasters"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Lothal is frequently asked in SSC exams as the famous dockyard city of the Indus Valley Civilization.",
        "Mohenjo-daro is known for the Great Bath, Great Granary, and the Bronze Dancing Girl figurine.",
        "Dholavira is notable for its unique water harvesting system and three-tier city planning structure."
      ],
      "id": "zl82u9z"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "p09ygtk",
      "content": "• Decline in trade"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "64jufiq",
      "content": "• Possible Aryan migration theory (debated)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecxf7f3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.SSC Exam Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bvat0m3",
      "content": "• Indus Valley script is still undeciphered"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vkkmq4w",
      "content": "• Lothal is famous for dockyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1z0lybp",
      "content": "• Dholavira is known for water management"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "54n0nfz",
      "content": "• Harappa civilization is also called Bronze Age civilization"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gbjqpk3",
      "content": "• Great Bath is located in Mohenjo‑daro"
    }
  ],
